Package: orphand-snaps
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mario Herrmann <marioherrmann@posteo.de>
Homepage: https://github.com/Mylinde/orphand_snaps
Description: Remove orphaned and disabled snap packages
 A utility that finds and removes orphaned snap packages unless they are
 default providers or bases. Also removes disabled snaps.
 .
 Features:
 - Bash shell script
 - Systemd service and weekly timer
 - Automatic elevation via sudo or doas
 - Undo functionality to restore removed snaps
Depends: snapd, util-linux
Suggests: doas, sudo
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
